{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Dinoland Manager</strong> \u2013 a charming and challenging cartoon-style simulation game! <br>Start from scratch and build a world-class dinosaur park: raise a wide variety of unique dinos, design smart visitor paths, handle unexpected emergencies, and turn your humble attraction into a legendary prehistoric paradise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/6519074d5e88494af48289feade4be78.poster.avif?t=1748620314\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/6519074d5e88494af48289feade4be78.webm?t=1748620314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/6519074d5e88494af48289feade4be78.mp4?t=1748620314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a meticulous management pro or a laid-back dino lover, this is your stage to shine.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Care for Unique Dinosaurs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dinosaur has its own personality\u2014from terrain preferences and favorite foods to social needs and toy demands.<br>T-Rex prefers solitude, Brachiosaurus loves a good stroll, and some dinos just won\u2019t settle unless they\u2019re surrounded by trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/57496e5879792a52c553a2c64b239f6b.poster.avif?t=1748620314\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/57496e5879792a52c553a2c64b239f6b.webm?t=1748620314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/57496e5879792a52c553a2c64b239f6b.mp4?t=1748620314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By meeting their needs, you'll cultivate a lineup of prehistoric superstars! Each dino comes with personality traits, and offspring may inherit or mutate these traits. Build your ultimate dino dream team and attract crowds of excited visitors!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Entertain Visitors &amp; Handle the Unexpected</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visitors don\u2019t just come to see the dinos\u2014they want sufficient food and drinks, cozy benches, and a park that looks well-kept.<br>Different visitor types have different preferences, and VIPs are especially picky\u2014but the rewards for keeping them happy are well worth the effort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/dde95f03e8d144de15b73943b31c2377.poster.avif?t=1748620314\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/dde95f03e8d144de15b73943b31c2377.webm?t=1748620314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/dde95f03e8d144de15b73943b31c2377.mp4?t=1748620314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just make sure your dinos are properly taken care of\u2014because if one breaks out, the excitement might quickly turn into chaos and panic!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Staff &amp; Keep Things Running</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your staff are the backbone of your park. Assign paleontologists, feeders, security guards, and cleaners to the right jobs and keep everything running smoothly.<br>Send out expeditions to dig up fossils and unlock new dinosaur species!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/3fb886ad0f45495f491ccc2e1fba5304.poster.avif?t=1748620314\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/3fb886ad0f45495f491ccc2e1fba5304.webm?t=1748620314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/3fb886ad0f45495f491ccc2e1fba5304.mp4?t=1748620314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your park grows, you\u2019ll be able to train staff, build a high-efficiency team, and keep things under control\u2014at least until the next dino decides to test the fences.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3745160?t=1748620314","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/2bd2190a7bd503a71c83a3a3a791c18eccad6a44/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748620314","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/731c249369a13d7b03a0d55ba9c6a5d5992c97d5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748620314","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/731c249369a13d7b03a0d55ba9c6a5d5992c97d5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748620314","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Dinoland Manager</strong> \u2013 a charming and challenging cartoon-style simulation game! <br>Start from scratch and build a world-class dinosaur park: raise a wide variety of unique dinos, design smart visitor paths, handle unexpected emergencies, and turn your humble attraction into a legendary prehistoric paradise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/6519074d5e88494af48289feade4be78.poster.avif?t=1748620314\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/6519074d5e88494af48289feade4be78.webm?t=1748620314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/6519074d5e88494af48289feade4be78.mp4?t=1748620314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a meticulous management pro or a laid-back dino lover, this is your stage to shine.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Care for Unique Dinosaurs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dinosaur has its own personality\u2014from terrain preferences and favorite foods to social needs and toy demands.<br>T-Rex prefers solitude, Brachiosaurus loves a good stroll, and some dinos just won\u2019t settle unless they\u2019re surrounded by trees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/57496e5879792a52c553a2c64b239f6b.poster.avif?t=1748620314\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/57496e5879792a52c553a2c64b239f6b.webm?t=1748620314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/57496e5879792a52c553a2c64b239f6b.mp4?t=1748620314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By meeting their needs, you'll cultivate a lineup of prehistoric superstars! Each dino comes with personality traits, and offspring may inherit or mutate these traits. Build your ultimate dino dream team and attract crowds of excited visitors!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Entertain Visitors &amp; Handle the Unexpected</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visitors don\u2019t just come to see the dinos\u2014they want sufficient food and drinks, cozy benches, and a park that looks well-kept.<br>Different visitor types have different preferences, and VIPs are especially picky\u2014but the rewards for keeping them happy are well worth the effort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/dde95f03e8d144de15b73943b31c2377.poster.avif?t=1748620314\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/dde95f03e8d144de15b73943b31c2377.webm?t=1748620314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/dde95f03e8d144de15b73943b31c2377.mp4?t=1748620314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just make sure your dinos are properly taken care of\u2014because if one breaks out, the excitement might quickly turn into chaos and panic!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage Staff &amp; Keep Things Running</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your staff are the backbone of your park. Assign paleontologists, feeders, security guards, and cleaners to the right jobs and keep everything running smoothly.<br>Send out expeditions to dig up fossils and unlock new dinosaur species!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/3fb886ad0f45495f491ccc2e1fba5304.poster.avif?t=1748620314\" width=600 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/3fb886ad0f45495f491ccc2e1fba5304.webm?t=1748620314\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/extras/3fb886ad0f45495f491ccc2e1fba5304.mp4?t=1748620314\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your park grows, you\u2019ll be able to train staff, build a high-efficiency team, and keep things under control\u2014at least until the next dino decides to test the fences.</p>","developers":["Lemonova Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/f6d052484e00a32ccf8b51c1b8e6c67587d693ce/header.jpg?t=1748620314","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3745160/648192614/18e80823ce85427386db673a130c0b524ba3e1b4/1750386082/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748620307","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3745160/648192614/18e80823ce85427386db673a130c0b524ba3e1b4/1750386082/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748620307","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3745160/648192614/18e80823ce85427386db673a130c0b524ba3e1b4/1750386082/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1748620307","id":257145605,"mp4":{"48