210f140a1d0fab0d81f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1748620314","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745160/ca0c0f8992620fbaa1001210f140a1d0fab0d81f/ss_ca0c0f8992620fbaa1001210f140a1d0fab0d81f.600x338.jpg?t=1748620314"}],"short_description":"Build your very own dinosaur theme park, care for over 50 unique and quirky dinos, hire and manage your staff, satisfy a wide range of visitor needs, handle unexpected chaos, and create the most unforgettable Jurassic paradise ever!","steam_appid":3745160,"support_info":{"email":"3836243245@qq.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}